cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hades in your work, please cite it as below."
title: Hades
abstract: >-
  Hades builds a queryable knowledge graph of a Unity project — its scenes,
  prefabs, scripts, assets and the references between them — and serves it to
  MCP-compatible coding agents over local HTTP, so an agent can read structural
  facts about a project instead of inferring them from text search. It works on
  any Unity project, including simulations, training environments and digital
  twins, and runs entirely on the user's machine with no telemetry.
type: software
